      "body": "## 介绍\n\nTINKER 是一个提升效率的跨平台桌面工具箱，内置了多个精选工具，涵盖开发、设计、日常办公等多个场景，同时可以通过 npm 自由编写安装插件。\n\n### 亮点\n\n* 一键快捷键呼出，搜索即用，用完自动隐藏。\n* 内置 30 + 高质量常用插件，持续更新。\n* 无需注册，纯本地运行，数据不上传服务器。\n* 支持 npm 自定义插件，免审核扩展，已集成近 20 个优质第三方插件。\n* 支持搜索本地应用。\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68e544c9-cc48-4fb6-9782-0df8cae92189\" />\n\n## 相关链接\n\n* [Github](https://github.com/liriliri/tinker)\n* [官网](https://tinker.liriliri.io/)\n\n## 部分插件截图\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e41b61a-2d99-4550-90ef-96cb2517431a\" />\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e32a8381-d70f-4761-9b68-8bcf9b0529a4\" />\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/445743ed-0177-45d1-8964-f5b04bfb9b3b\" />\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a17c060-f35d-4436-8348-4a30605ffa91\" />\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64f72613-7c9b-4a9e-a901-953f96f26816\" />\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af99f764-7fbd-417e-b70c-e74de11b2412\" />\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/714f74f0-1e37-4a6e-b9b0-45dd9041d227\" />\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/513dab68-3451-4363-8b4e-e512ccbd3a14\" />\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e183bd01-3297-4c35-b1fa-6b3caf8d0671\" />\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4b44418-c539-4525-a433-8d1fcef79707\" />\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments